      "notes": "Published cubic fit to earlier X-ray densities, not an independent Brillouin EOS. No zero-pressure reference is implied. Figure 9 triangles are Eq.(6) values, with open triangles extrapolated, not measured observations. The source uses B_T=rho*dP/drho and approximates B_S=B_T except near melting. Tables II-III are elastic bounds dependent on Eq.(6). Do not convert longitudinal modulus C=rho*v^2 into solid bulk modulus. Coefficient error/covariance, precise room temperature and low-pressure diffraction fit cutoff are unspecified. Ref.17 Hazen et al.(1980), Carnegie Yearb.79,348; ref.18 Zou et al.(1982), Yearb.81,392; ref.19 Xu et al.(1984), High Temp.High Pressures16,495. Theory pair-potential curves are separate and are not this fit.",
